{"id": "ec4abfc1-a8f6-443f-ac2c-1d0f6b3b03f6", "role": "assistant", "block_type": "thinking", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "I'm noticing CloudWatch Logs integration isn't configured either—the trail details lack fields like CloudWatchLogsLogGroupArn, CloudWatchLogsRoleArn, KmsKeyId, and SnsTopicName, so none of those are set up. I should check the S3 bucket name used for storing the logs.

Since the trail is single-region and based in us-east-1, events from other regions aren't captured locally, and with IncludeGlobalServiceEvents set to false, global service events like IAM, STS, and CloudFront activity won't be logged either—that's a notable gap. Now I'm ready to put together the findings report.

